{"title":"Thursday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/916849421/0/marginalrevolution~Thursday-assorted-links.html","date":1744906211000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/scottmelker/status/1912573767684874618\" target=\"_blank\">Jerome Powell on stablecoins</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://hollisrobbinsanecdotal.substack.com/p/harvard-will-survive?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1004053&amp;post_id=161499023&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Hollis Robbins on o3 and higher education</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/1911975454107701512?t=ouCWptQDVsJgMCFHIDJPMg&amp;s=08\" target=\"_blank\">Google has started hiring for “post-AGI research.”</a>  If you want one, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/evanon0ping/status/1912582927856333057\" target=\"_blank\">a straightforward definition of AGI</a>.  I believe o3 passes that test, including for the one hour of human labor mark.  I hear lots of complaining, but I don’t hear people, even the small-minded men who occupy one tiny corner of this debate, arguing it fails that test.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/DeryaTR_/status/1912662575126573324\" target=\"_blank\">Derya on o3 and immunobiology</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/tweetatpablo/status/1912600634446258584\" target=\"_blank\">Pablo on o3 and the law</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/iruletheworldmo/status/1912816180626149569\" target=\"_blank\">the strawberries guy</a>.  Also <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/AndrewCurran_/status/1912553018828238915\" target=\"_blank\">Greg Brockman comments</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/04/16/science/astronomy-exoplanets-habitable-k218b.html\" target=\"_blank\">Biosignatures on a habitable planet?</a> (NYT)  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.washingtonpost.com/science/2025/04/16/alien-life-exoplanet-webb-telescope/\" target=\"_blank\">WaPo on the same</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sebkrier/status/1912717851137343516\" target=\"_blank\">Market-based mechanisms for AI agents</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.hyperdimensional.co/p/take-off?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2244049&amp;post_id=161506952&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Dean Ball</a>, formerly of Mercatus and with excellent taste in music: “I am pleased to announce that as of this week, I have taken on the role of Senior Policy Advisor for AI and Emerging Technology at the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.whitehouse.gov/ostp/\">White House Office of Science and Technology Policy</a>.”</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.cnn.com/2025/04/02/health/novavax-covid-vaccine-fda-delay/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">Delays for full Novavax authorization</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/thursday-assorted-links-498.html\">Thursday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/916849421/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/916849421/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/916849421/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/916849421/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/916849421/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/916849421/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/thursday-assorted-links-498.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/thursday-assorted-links-498.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/thursday-assorted-links-498.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/thursday-assorted-links-498.html#comment-160903354\">In reply to Colin.   JOIN US Everybody can earn 250/h Dollar + ...</a> <i>by Kathrine Barrera</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/thursday-assorted-links-498.html#comment-160903200\">In reply to Colin.   Google is now paying $300 to $500 per hour ...</a> <i>by Keeley</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/thursday-assorted-links-498.html#comment-160902954\">In repl